      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb four-bedroom bungalow to the market at No. 498 Bluebell Avenue, Dublin 12.\nIdeally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential location, Bluebell Avenue offers a fantastic combination of convenience and accessibility. Residents benefit from a wealth of amenities close by, including local shops, supermarkets, schools, parks and recreational facilities, while the property is also within easy reach of Walkinstown and Ballymount. Excellent transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, with the M50 motorway also readily accessible, making this an ideal location for both families and commuters.\nInternally, the accommodation extends to an impressive c. 103 sq. m. and is presented in great condition overall. The property offers well-proportioned rooms throughout, with four bedrooms providing excellent flexibility for modern family living, alongside a spacious living area, kitchen and family bathroom. The generous overall floorspace ensures plenty of scope for a variety of buyers and lifestyle requirements.\nThe property further benefits from its bungalow layout, making it particularly appealing to families, first-time buyers and those looking for accommodation all on one level. Its excellent condition, generous proportions and vacant possession combine to make this a fantastic opportunity in a well-established Dublin 12 location.\nThe combination of spacious accommodation, superb condition and an enviable location makes No. 498 Bluebell Avenue a property not to be missed. Early viewing is highly advised to appreciate everything this wonderful home has to offer.\nFeatures\n•4 bed/1 bath bungalow\n•c. 103 sq. m. of generous floorspace\n•BER D\n•Presented in great condition overall\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Spacious and well-proportioned accommodation\n•Highly sought-after and mature location\n•Excellent transport links\n•Close to a host of local amenities\n•Ideal family / first-time buyer home\nDirections\nD12 FK52\n"
      },
      {
